{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/27035618087216b85388b73bbf7460e8.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=699 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Congratulations.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without qualifications, without a degree, and without the slightest credibility, the <strong><i>Last Breath Clinic</i></strong> entrusts you with the position of <i>general practitioner</i> within its hospital factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome patients, examine them, diagnose, and prescribe with caution. A mistake can happen so quickly\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any questions, complaints, or special requests, please refer to our motto:<br><strong><i>\u201cHealth has a price, and everyone must contribute.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/9f1aecb712dad0feccb60b6d597065b0.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/e0c9e8a9c85b56aef41be72b21665ae1.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>Every patient is a potential fraudster. You have been warned.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fake name, expired card, invalid insurance? It\u2019s up to you to keep undesirables from accessing healthcare. You are the last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Management is watching you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/010866f20fd242111a7c404a2ffcdb64.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/57ec6323a301179f3485375e2ef67ace.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Put away your rudimentary tools: medicine is serious business.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, Management equips you with the finest French medical technology. True diagnostic weapons, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a rechargeable battery-powered flashlight</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a thermometer that goes beep-beep</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>an intra-auricular blood pressure monitor</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>a suspicious-odor sniffer</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/fc94eeb0622d1debac4a849c76b65543.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/141c56586593073724fcaff89e2dfca9.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stranger-than-strange diseases\u2026</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visceral sensitivity to light (vomiting included), sudden appearance of a wagging tail, or instant hair regrowth\u2026 Here, every symptom is a surprise, every diagnosis a gamble, and every mistake leaves a mark\u2014on your paycheck as well as in tomorrow\u2019s news.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/0a6e43866db3ce7f4b0b652f6f4748fe.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1560 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/2529bef0619bfaa40ec0204edccca217.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.poster.avif?t=1770999607\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.webm?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954850/extras/62e7fa7438c09756c6bbf51bd74a8606.mp4?t=1770999607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Schemes, lies, bribes, and retaliation.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, being a doctor is not limited to treating patients. Every decision matters. Some choices make survival easier. Others bring it to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this world, a single mistake can cost more than your reputation.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You learn on the job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/e22eabfcacf439341fd110c2382732287cd6a96a.jpg"},{"name":"Under the desk!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/ab34847981048ca55e73b4fa6ffcf04198d0f861.jpg"},{"name":"ACHOO!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/282e0a2c14da482ce92bbc276940e2b98dbe3a7f.jpg"},{"name":"Pay here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/30c1bb33d899c822a14d9ad277aeac57dc728add.jpg"},{"name":"Grave Robber!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/7e969017ec7dfadf7e89c028b8a808f031d61a4b.jpg"},{"name":"Kill One!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/b27b774a025f52a227629b1b275b8486b5347039.jpg"},{"name":"Hot on Your Heels!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/02009abc899b05bce046741744536ddf77b859ca.jpg"},{"name":"Fate Sealed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/b1313b657d75df3e2f12dbc3b093a64c89a17ac1.jpg"},{"name":"Good French","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954850/fb91531679a0116e4266f16c707e92e488a16df7.jpg"},{"name":"Abracadabrantastic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic